# Grid B — U7 History Diff + Current Source Impact
#
# Regression target: a commit diff can be first-class VCS evidence while the
# current checkout explains the present implementation/impact. The answer must
# keep both lanes visible instead of forcing old diff hunks into current
# file:line citations or collapsing the request to one commit id/value.
#
# Ground truth drifts whenever this repository receives a new commit. Keep this
# case shape-oriented: it should mention diff/commit provenance, current code or
# current implementation, and the impact/flow relationship.
ID="u7o"
NAME="history — latest diff plus current source impact"
QUESTION="根据最近一次提交的代码 diff，再结合当前源码，分析这次改动对现在实现链路的影响；请说明 commit/diff 线索、当前关键代码，以及影响关系，不要只给 commit id。"
# Do not ban the literal phrase "**值：**" here: this mixed history/current-code
# case often analyzes fixes to scalar rendering itself, where quoting the bad
# scalar label is valid explanatory content. The positive regex below guards the
# actual product shape: diff provenance + current implementation + impact.
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=""
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(commit|提交|diff|差异).*(当前|源码|现在|实现)|(当前|源码|现在|实现).*(commit|提交|diff|差异)
(影响|链路|关系|流程|修复链路).*(当前|源码|现在|实现|实现链路)|(当前|源码|现在|实现|实现链路).*(影响|链路|关系|流程|修复链路)"
